  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Supporting State Capacity for Inclusive Recovery in Lebanon</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To strengthen the Lebanese state&apos;s capacity to lead inclusive recovery by supporting four ministries in developing evidence-based strategies in trade, investment, housing and public sector reform. Target groups include government institutions, productive firms, and vulnerable households.</narrative>
  </description>
